# Google Gemini API key for the Foods-page "Auto-fill missing macros" feature.
# Get one from https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/api-key
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your key. Vite only inlines
# build-time vars prefixed with VITE_, so the name must be exactly this.
#
# SECURITY: this is a pure client-side app with no backend, so the key is
# inlined into the shipped bundle and visible to anyone who loads it. Only set
# it for a personal/local build. Leaving it unset simply hides the auto-fill
# control; the rest of the app is unaffected.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
